{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q1", "domain": "unknown", "question": "此命出生家境如何？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析：年柱辛卯，伤官坐正官，且辛金盖头克卯木官星，代表祖上或父母辈在官运方面易有波折，难显贵气。月柱己亥，劫财坐偏财，己土盖头克制亥水偏财，偏财为父，受劫财所克，显示父亲财运不佳，易有破耗，从商则多竞争压力，难成巨富。日主戊土得日支午火正印、时柱丁巳偏印强生，印星旺盛为用，印代表母亲，主母亲有文化或一定职权，但在基层。综合来看，父亲有从商之象但财被劫，母亲可能在村里担任职务，符合“父从商母是村干部”之象。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q1", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P0_G0\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 28864, "response_id": "21b31c48-0d48-437a-baa7-8ed2da3f919e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 211, "completion_tokens": 1368, "total_tokens": 1579, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1187}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 83}}
{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q2", "domain": "relationship", "question": "婚姻如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命盘分析，女命日主戊土，以木为官杀夫星。年柱辛卯，正官卯木坐下，但被年干辛金伤官直接盖头克制，形成“伤官坐官”的凶格，女命逢之主婚姻波折，不利头婚。日支夫宫午火为阳刃桃花，与年支官星卯木相破，夫妻宫受损，暗示关系不睦。月支亥水与卯木半合木局，夫星有气但被伤官所伤。时柱丁火印星可遥制辛金，但解救之力迟来，主晚运稍安。\n\n大运方面，早年辛丑运伤官强旺，官星受损，婚恋艰难。壬寅运七杀透出，夫缘出现，但原局官杀混杂，易有重婚之象。癸卯运正官重现，与原局伤官引发冲克，初婚易破。综合来看，伤官见官而夫宫受损，多为二次婚姻之兆，故断二婚。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q2", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P0_G0\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 48755, "response_id": "bafdc0dd-3406-4109-92e7-1d6a694fbbeb", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 207, "completion_tokens": 2466, "total_tokens": 2673, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2227}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 79}}
